<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-27T19:31:41.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:31:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran is intensifying threats to the region, urging the reopening of the Strait of Hormuz while Houthi missiles and drones continue striking Saudi oil facilities and airports, prompting the reopening of Riyadh Airport after weeks of disruption. Qatar is urging Iran to end these threats and reopen the strait, while Saudi, Turkish and Pakistani officials are preparing talks with Iran to defuse tensions. The United States is considering renewed strikes on Iran, driving oil prices above $117 a barrel. Iran’s Supreme Leader and top security chief discussed war and Hormuz, and the Saudi-led coalition reported downing Houthi missiles and drones aimed at the kingdom. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/qatar-urges-iran-to-show-goodwill-by-ending-threats-to-the-region-and-reopening-the-strait&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/23/oil-five-month-high-fears-us-renews-strikes-iran&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOUTN5QzFhYWJ3eDVSc3JpcDlXLUZWMTJMSzZEc1haU2wtZlQ3LTlRekxnNEF5SThHbHZzUHZoWWFNTXNMa0VVc2NNaDlVTW5UWXl5SEhPTkwzQjFxVkpvemphQUw4Y3k5enRJQ0Y0VnVjWjh2ZmlIYXBHZ3V2bzlqdFNVUEs1eXliUVpXNktRNnM3UngyVnNzb2I5MXdZMFdzbXRjOWVDckJocExXUzJiUnJDYXF3UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQZlhqbzVQSTlhY3I2N01SQ3QwRWlGRGJTbGtrc3FCU1VEQ0ZjVjFudFJITU9OY3hXVy1zbktyQ2pDakN3cWVlWFc1cjQ1VjVBNDBxa3ZtZVVrY0w4dzk0YURyU1d4OW9RaEhKRkhXcGo4TDdBUnVNdDBocG9lU0x6bnF3cW1LbUFud1dXQUc5NC1EWGdGMF9SQjdjb0pKZnNsYkdDUUVkY0NuOUZNUkJ6VGlzanJNZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBQVzAxYU5yenF2WEVTQ3E2MF